What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int a = 17, b = 5;
System.out.println(a / b * b + a % b);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
double d = 7 / 2;
int n = (int) 3.9 + (int) (2.6 + 1.6);
System.out.println(d + " " + n);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int x = Integer.MAX_VALUE;
int y = x + 1;
long z = x + 1;
long w = x + 1L;
System.out.println(y + " " + z + " " + w);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int x = 10;
x *= 2.5;
x -= 0.9;
System.out.println(x);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int i = 3;
int j = i++ + ++i;
System.out.println(i + " " + j);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
char c = 'a';
c += 2;
int n = c + 1;
System.out.println(c + " " + n + " " + (char) n);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int r = (int) Math.round(2.5) + (int) Math.round(-2.5) + (int) Math.pow(2, 3);
System.out.println(r);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int a = 5;
double b = a / 2;
double c = a / 2.0;
boolean t = (b == 2) && (c == 2.5);
System.out.println(t + " " + (a / 2 * 2.0));
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int total = 7 + 8 + 10;
double avg = total / 3;
double avg2 = total / 3.0;
double avg3 = (double) (total / 3);
double avg4 = (double) total / 3;
System.out.println(avg + " " + avg2 + " " + avg3 + " " + avg4);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int x = 5;
x = x++ * 2 + x;
System.out.println(x);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int a = 7;
a /= 2;
a *= 3.5;
a %= 4;
System.out.println(a);
```
